# Godot: do not scan this folder.
#
# This repo carries a SECOND copy of every plugin script (the addon it ships)
# with the same class_name declarations as the ACTIVE addon at
# res://addons/highpoly_toggle. Without this file the editor compiles both,
# and any edit or git operation here while the editor is open hot-reloads
# scripts under running code - which is a "Bad address index" crash mid-build
# (godot-crash-2026-08-10_01-34-44.log). The deployed addon is unaffected:
# deploys copy files there, and that path is outside this folder.
